{"id":"n78089-1-15","stage":5,"title":"척추 · 脊椎","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78089-1-15-1","ko":"엄마, 저 요즘 허리가 너무 아파요.","zh":"妈妈，我最近腰疼得厉害。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"저","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"허리가","meaning":"腰","explanation":"허리：腰；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"허리","audio":"/audio/777cb8e22269860361d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30201","senseId":"1","lemma":"허리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"허리가","audio":"/audio/ce5c6c7b6a73dfaf9320.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"아파요.","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아파요","audio":"/audio/0d77fc96982cfc284c03.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"777cb8e222698603","term":"허리","zh":"腰","audio":"/audio/777cb8e22269860361d6.mp3","entryId":"30201","definition":"人或动物身体上从肋骨下方到尾骨的部分。","pronunciation":["허리"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]}],"audio":"/audio/658303b48d57e7d9f147.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n78089-1-15-2","ko":"그러니까 똑바로 앉지 않으면 척추에 이상이 생긴다고 했잖니.","zh":"我不是跟你说过，如果不坐直的话，脊椎就会出问题的吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러니까","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그러니까：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그러니까","audio":"/audio/f064d1058a27cd3851f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58609","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러니까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러니까","audio":"/audio/f064d1058a27cd3851f3.mp3"}},{"text":"똑바로","meaning":"正，径直，直接","explanation":"똑바로：正，径直，直接","readings":[{"term":"똑바로","audio":"/audio/934c2296a0e275800788.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70810","senseId":"1","lemma":"똑바로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"똑바로","audio":"/audio/934c2296a0e275800788.mp3"}},{"text":"앉지","meaning":"坐","explanation":"앉다：坐；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앉지","audio":"/audio/0d14dcb0ca579b284215.mp3"}},{"text":"않으면","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않으면","audio":"/audio/d096a85957f74d1fe3b5.mp3"}},{"text":"척추에","meaning":"脊椎","explanation":"척추：脊椎；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"척추","audio":"/audio/1a756ae790c5dbeac10d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78089","senseId":"1","lemma":"척추","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"척추에","audio":"/audio/b9d3a1803ac307a71bc3.mp3"}},{"text":"이상이","meaning":"异常","explanation":"이상：异常；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이상","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71998","senseId":"1","lemma":"이상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이상이","audio":"/audio/d295791c13585c612475.mp3"}},{"text":"생긴다고","meaning":"发生，产生","explanation":"생기다：发生，产生；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"3","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생긴다고","audio":"/audio/d7fd2bc9026f7497f74f.mp3"}},{"text":"했잖니.","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；잖니：提醒听者双方已知的事实，带反问或确认语气：“不是……吗”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했잖니","audio":"/audio/d452ab48341ef443307a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f064d1058a27cd38","term":"그러니까","zh":"因此，所以","audio":"/audio/f064d1058a27cd3851f3.mp3","entryId":"58609","definition":"因为那个原因；或因为那样的缘故。","pronunciation":["그러니까"]},{"id":"934c2296a0e27580","term":"똑바로","zh":"正，径直，直接","audio":"/audio/934c2296a0e275800788.mp3","entryId":"70810","definition":"不偏向一侧，直直地。","pronunciation":["똑빠로"]},{"id":"17e77d3fb6b2dbdb","term":"앉다","zh":"坐","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3","entryId":"71463","definition":"挺直上半身，将臀部置于别的物体或地上以支持身体的重量。","pronunciation":["안따"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"17186","definition":"不做某种行动。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"1a756ae790c5dbea","term":"척추","zh":"脊椎","audio":"/audio/1a756ae790c5dbeac10d.mp3","entryId":"78089","definition":"由从颈部至臀部排成的骨头形成的身体部位。","pronunciation":["척추"]},{"id":"e6e77b83100b28e7","term":"이상","zh":"异常","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3","entryId":"71998","definition":"与普通情况或平时不同的状态。","pronunciation":["이ː상"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"发生，产生","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"出现事故或事情、问题等。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5636bc35df6422087505.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.036,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=78089","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":174,"sequenceScore":3.5127,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["妈妈，我最近腰疼得厉害。","我不是跟你说过，如果不坐直的话，脊椎就会出问题的吗？","你向村里的长辈问好，真做得很好啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["妈妈，我最近腰疼得厉害。","我不是跟你说过，如果不坐直的话，脊椎就会出问题的吗？","你向村里的长辈问好，真做得很好啊。"],"answer":1}]}
